{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1337.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"22e23b1ffb9eccd82cb2d1446ab8972ed757355dade87a5fbe751da577363726","ja":"みんな、おはようさん……って、\nなにを読んでるんだい？","zh":"大家，早上好啊……咦，\n你们在看什么呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1337.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"625b415a4cfa96df14c60d6f47e598f22e5d2e14f0577dc7d0420c6db5a99e61","ja":"ああ、この間、美希とヤッコとヒナで\n取材を受けただろ。その記事を見てたんだ。","zh":"啊，前阵子美希、八子和雏不是\n接受了采访吗。我正在看那篇报道。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1337.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"ab31e5dc49c34415717a10866088f9c632493e44142a20c9aa9328b721297a46","ja":"楽しい雰囲気が……すごく、伝わってくる……よ。","zh":"能很强烈地……感受到……快乐的气氛……呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1337.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5fc64d4a1ef9ece3dfd8b5e075adf82af6222565c1b3972ed9e7323880c0d0ff","ja":"ええーっ、本当かい？　あたし、あの日はすごく\n運が悪くてねぇ、取材もうまくいかなかったのに……。","zh":"诶——真的吗？我那天运气\n特别背，采访进行得也很不顺利呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1337.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"70b5b64d003fefeac9ec40019f6de600a2852b8208b0d32d5427ef63638d4959","ja":"あはっ☆　ミキの言った通りになったでしょ。\nマイナスとマイナスで、プラスになったの♪","zh":"啊哈☆　正如美希所说的那样吧。\n负负得正了哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1337.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"904c330b2260260c41e1b193f2bd6ee7c62385e2bb736cb87b611cee0912a732","ja":"内容がよかったからって、\n予定より、ページ数を増やしてくれたんだよ！","zh":"说是内容很不错，\n所以特意比原定计划增加了页数呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1337.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"7b701edff950fd68cc96938fc34d24d6b45658105909d5a45d52f3435e75693a","ja":"特に美希さんとひなたちゃんのことが、\nいーっぱい書かれてて、すごいなーって♪","zh":"关于美希小姐和小日向的事写了好多好多，\n真的好厉害呀～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1337.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"a1979265b7dadebf9bd06452718abbec2003ca641dcd5b6574059b8e128023ea","ja":"うん……「おふたりの、自己肯定感の高さは\n正しくギャルそのもの！」……だって。","zh":"嗯……说是“两位的自我认同感之高，\n完全可以说是如假包换的辣妹！”……呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1337.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"bcf11b37bf8e71c887adab70f55e497e0d6231fc123253184edd335c0fca0478","ja":"もしかしてあたし、マイナスをプラスにしようとして、\n本当のギャルになってしまったのかい！？","zh":"难道说我为了反败为胜，\n反而变成了货真价实的辣妹吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1337.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"507f9a306468625a8ef0eaf3704c4694a522b1e7e57c80449897ca04019c2722","ja":"よく分かんないけど、ポジティブなのが\n良かったんじゃないかな？","zh":"虽然不太明白，但够积极乐观\n应该挺不错的吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1337.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"6557254d971e1608ababe82cd4edef0a1b336e912c029f7279df7716f947a131","ja":"運が悪くても、考え方次第ってことなのかねぇ……。\nなんだか美希さんのお陰で勉強になったべさ♪","zh":"就算运气不好，也是取决于思考方式的吧……\n总觉得多亏了美希姐，真是学到东西了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
